## Interface: 20506
## Title: Spoken Quests
## Notes: Quest and gossip dialogue read aloud through Spoken. Restores quest and gossip voiceovers on current Classic clients.
## Notes-deDE: Quest- und Gesprächsdialoge, vorgelesen durch Spoken. Stellt die Quest- und Gesprächs-Vertonungen auf aktuellen Classic-Clients wieder her.
## Notes-esES: Diálogos de misiones y charlas leídos en voz alta a través de Spoken. Restaura las voces de misiones y charlas en clientes Classic actuales.
## Notes-esMX: Diálogos de misiones y charlas leídos en voz alta a través de Spoken. Restaura las voces de misiones y charlas en clientes Classic actuales.
## Notes-frFR: Dialogues de quêtes et de discussions lus à voix haute grâce à Spoken. Restaure les voix des quêtes et discussions sur les clients Classic actuels.
## Notes-ptBR: Diálogos de missões e conversas lidos em voz alta através do Spoken. Restaura as vozes de missões e conversas em clientes Classic atuais.
## Notes-ruRU: Диалоги заданий и разговоров, озвученные через Spoken. Возвращает озвучку заданий и разговоров на текущих клиентах Classic.
## Notes-koKR: Spoken으로 퀘스트와 잡담 대사를 소리내어 읽습니다. 최신 Classic 클라이언트에서 퀘스트와 잡담 음성을 복원합니다.
## Notes-zhCN: 通过 Spoken 朗读任务和闲聊对话。在当前的经典怀旧服客户端上恢复任务和闲聊语音。
## Notes-zhTW: 透過 Spoken 朗讀任務和閒聊對話。在當前的經典客戶端上恢復任務和閒聊語音。
## Version: 3.3.0
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Spoken_Quests\icon.tga
## SavedVariables: SpokenQuestsSettings
## OptionalDeps: Spoken, DialogueUI
# Spoken is the player this addon speaks through: optional, so a hand-installed copy
# without it loads and says what is missing; addon managers install it from the
# CurseForge dependency.
# DialogueUI, when installed, loads first so its window exists to be hooked: UI/DialogueUIBridge.lua.
## Group: Spoken
## X-Part-Of: Spoken
## X-VoiceOver-Player: 1

